Emerging Market Opportunities
Advanced Silicon-Based Anodes
Silicon-enhanced anodes offer the potential to improve battery energy density compared with conventional graphite-based materials. Companies developing silicon-anode technologies are creating opportunities for higher-performance batteries used in premium electric vehicles and advanced electronics.

Solid-State Battery Development
Solid-state battery platforms are attracting investment because of their potential to improve safety, energy density, and battery performance. Their commercialization could create new demand for specialized electrolytes, electrode materials, and advanced manufacturing inputs.

Battery Recycling and Circular Supply Chains
Closed-loop recycling can recover lithium, nickel, cobalt, and graphite from end-of-life batteries, reducing dependence on newly mined resources. Investment in recycling facilities and material recovery technologies is creating opportunities for companies seeking more resilient and sustainable supply chains.

